 "titulo": "Too ugly to be rewarded, so he became the demon king 👹 Zhong Kui Part 1 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "TOO UGLY TO WIN",
 "descripcion": "Zhong Kui came first in the imperial exam. Then the Emperor saw his face. What happened next on the palace steps turned a scholar into China's most feared demon hunter.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWas the Emperor right to judge him by his face?\n\nFrom the Chinese legend of Zhong Kui, as recorded by Shen Kuo in Mengxi Bitan (11th century) and in later Ming-era versions.\n#zhongkui #chinesemythology #mythology #ancientchina #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "He came *first* in all of China, and lost everything because of his face.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "His name was Zhong Kui, a scholar from the Zhongnan Mountains.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Huge, dark, with a wild beard and eyes like fire.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But nobody in the empire wrote better than him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the exam was the only door out of poverty.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Thousands of scholars traveled to the capital for the imperial exam.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Zhong Kui walked for weeks, with his best friend, *Du Ping*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "When the results were posted, his name was at the very top.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He was led into the palace to meet the Emperor himself.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Emperor took one look at his face, and *turned away*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A man this ugly cannot be the top scholar of my empire.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The title was taken from him, right there, in front of the court.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Zhong Kui shouted that it was unjust. The guards drew their swords.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And in his rage, he threw himself headfirst against the *palace steps*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He died on the stone, in front of everyone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Du Ping carried his body home and buried him with honor.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "But in the world below, someone was watching. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
